# v1 is a static/informational site with no backend, database, or auth, so
# almost nothing needs a real secret here.
#
# Client-exposure rule (Next.js): only variables prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ are
# inlined into the browser bundle and are NOT secret. Anything without that
# prefix stays server-only. Never prefix a real secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_.

# Tawk.to live chat widget (free tier, approved by Sonny 2026-09-10).
# 1. Sign up at https://www.tawk.to (free) and create a property for this site.
# 2. Administration > Channels > Chat Widget — copy the Property ID and Widget ID
#    out of the embed URL: https://embed.tawk.to/<PROPERTY_ID>/<WIDGET_ID>
# 3. Paste them below. Not secret — Tawk.to's own embed script is public in every
#    page's source anyway. Widget renders nothing until both are set.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TAWKTO_PROPERTY_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_TAWKTO_WIDGET_ID=
